a7b78"},{"key":"89:25:4","position":4,"arabic":"عَذَابَهُۥٓ","kind":"word","gloss":"(as) His punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābahu","lemma":"عَذَاب","root":"عذب","entryId":"l-3eb7e15951d31876"},{"key":"89:25:5","position":5,"arabic":"أَحَدٌۭ","kind":"word","gloss":"anyone","transliteration":"aḥadun","lemma":"أَحَد","root":"احد","entryId":"l-4e0bd3447fb54c57"},{"key":"89:25:6","position":6,"arabic":"٢٥","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"89:26","translation":"And none will bind (the wicked, disbelievers and polytheists) as He will bind.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"89:26:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَلَا","kind":"word","gloss":"And not","transliteration":"walā","lemma":"لَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-93952243ccc22536"},{"key":"89:26:2","position":2,"arabic":"يُوثِقُ","kind":"word","gloss":"will bind","transliteration":"yūthiqu","lemma":"يُوثِقُ","root":"وثق","entryId":null},{"key":"89:26:3","position":3,"arabic":"وَثَاقَهُۥٓ","kind":"word","gloss":"(as) His binding","transliteration":"wathāqahu","lemma":"وَثَاق","root":"وثق","entryId":null},{"key":"89:26:4","position":4,"arabic":"أَحَدٌۭ","kind":"word","gloss":"anyone","transliteration":"aḥadun","lemma":"أَحَد","root":"احد","entryId":"l-4e0bd3447fb54c57"},{"key":"89:26:5","position":5,"arabic":"٢٦","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"89:27","translation":"(It will be said to the pious believers of Islamic Monotheism): \"O (you) the one in (complete) rest and satisfaction!","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"89:27:1","position":1,"arabic":"يَـٰٓأَيَّتُهَا","kind":"word","gloss":"O","transliteration":"yāayyatuhā","lemma":"أَيَّتُهَا","root":"ايي","entryId":null},{"key":"89:27:2","position":2,"arabic":"ٱلنَّفْسُ","kind":"word","gloss":"soul","transliteration":"l-nafsu","lemma":"نَفْس","root":"نفس","entryId":"l